cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "AntibiogramJ Web"
abstract: >-
  Web application for the analysis of disk-diffusion antibiogram images: detection of the Petri dish and the
  antibiotic disks, OCR of the disk codes, measurement of inhibition zones, S/I/R categorisation with
  EUCAST/CLSI breakpoints, EUCAST expert rules and quality control. It runs entirely in the web browser
  (OpenCV.js and ONNX Runtime Web) or as a multi-user server (FastAPI).
